# Dialogue Studio — overview

Local Kokoro TTS studio: **Vite/React** (`frontend/`, port 5173) + **FastAPI** (`backend/app/main.py`, port 8000). No cloud keys, no SQL, no auth. Persistence is JSON under `data/`.

**Default model preference:** `kokoro-torch` until the user installs/selects ONNX (`model_q8f16` is the recommended ONNX id). One engine loaded at a time.

**UI vs speech language:** header EN/FA/DE is UI only; synth language stays in Delivery.

Commands: `npm run setup`, `npm run dev`. Tests: `backend` pytest; `frontend` `npm run build`.

Do not silently fall back between models. Do not enable ONNX graph optimizations. Tones are speed/pause markup, not native emotion.

Full agent guide: `AGENTS.md`.

